---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Is Lake View Park Islamabad Open Today?"
  description="Is Lake View Park Islamabad open today? This guide explains why we do not show a live ‘open now’ status and how to check before you set out."
  path="/open-today/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'Is Lake View Park open right now?', a: 'This guide does not show a live “Open Now” status because it is independent and does not connect to CDA or the park’s gates. Verify through official CDA announcements or on-site management instead.' },
    { q: 'When was this information last reviewed?', a: 'The general guidance was last reviewed on 4 November 2026. A review date is not a same-day opening confirmation — only a check date for the guidance.' },
    { q: 'What about weather closures?', a: 'Heavy rain, thunderstorms, strong wind and fog can affect access, paths and water activities. Read the park weather guidance and any official PMD warnings before setting out.' },
    { q: 'What should I confirm before leaving?', a: 'Don’t assume the gate is open or that a specific activity is running — confirm the particular thing you came for with management on arrival.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Open today', href: '/open-today/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Opening hours', href: '/opening-hours/' },
    { label: 'Ticket prices', href: '/ticket-prices/' },
    { label: 'Weather at the park', href: '/#weather' },
    { label: 'Location & map', href: '/location-map/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">This page is built for the moment you are about to leave and want to know whether Lake View Park is open. It does <strong>not</strong> show a live “Open Now” badge, and here is why that is deliberate.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Why there is no live status</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">This guide is independent and does not connect to CDA systems, the park’s gates or any real-time operations feed. Any automated “open/closed” label would be a guess presented as fact, which is exactly the kind of wrong information this guide avoids. Instead we point you to sources you can verify yourself.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Last reviewed</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">The general information on this site was last reviewed on <strong>4 November 2026</strong>. A review date is not a same-day opening confirmation — it only tells you when the guidance was checked.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">How to check today</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-8">
        <li>Look for any official CDA announcement or notice before a public holiday or event.</li>
        <li>Check the live map directions on the <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/location-map/">location page</a> for access and routing.</li>
        <li>Call or confirm with on-site management on arrival for gate and activity status.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Weather and temporary closures</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Heavy rain, thunderstorms, strong wind and fog can affect access, paths and water activities. A weather forecast does not itself announce a closure, but you should read <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/#weather">the park weather guidance</a> and any official PMD warnings before setting out.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-[#b3261e] bg-[#fdecea] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#b3261e]">Do not assume it is open</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#7a1c16]">Even when the park is generally accessible, specific facilities or activities can be closed for maintenance, weather or management reasons. Confirm the particular thing you came for — not just the gate.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Confirm the specific thing</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Even when the park is generally accessible, a specific facility or activity can be closed for maintenance, weather or management reasons. The right check is “is the thing I came for open?” — not just “is the gate open?”</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist title="Before you leave checklist" items={[
      'Check for official CDA announcements or notices.',
      'Read the park weather guidance and PMD warnings.',
      'Call or confirm gate and activity status on arrival.',
      'Confirm the specific thing you came for, not just the gate.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg" width="1280" height="960" alt="Calm Rawal Lake view from Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={2} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
